20の5分足・AI）</div><div class=\"fprof\"><div class=\"fpcol\"><div class=\"fpbar\" style=\"height:38px\"></div><span class=\"fplab\">9時</span></div><div class=\"fpcol\"><div class=\"fpbar\" style=\"height:46px\"></div><span class=\"fplab\"></span></div><div class=\"fpcol\"><div class=\"fpbar\" style=\"height:29px\"></div><span class=\"fplab\">10時</span></div><div class=\"fpcol\"><div class=\"fpbar\" style=\"height:16px\"></div><span class=\"fplab\"></span></div><div class=\"fpcol\"><div class=\"fpbar\" style=\"height:3px\"></div><span class=\"fplab\">11時</span></div><div class=\"fpcol\"><div class=\"fpbar\" style=\"height:21px\"></div><span class=\"fplab\">12時半</span></div><div class=\"fpcol\"><div class=\"fpbar\" style=\"height:10px\"></div><span class=\"fplab\"></span></div><div class=\"fpcol\"><div class=\"fpbar\" style=\"height:3px\"></div><span class=\"fplab\">13時半</span></div><div class=\"fpcol\"><div class=\"fpbar\" style=\"height:14px\"></div><span class=\"fplab\"></span></div><div class=\"fpcol\"><div class=\"fpbar\" style=\"height:8px\"></div><span class=\"fplab\">14時半</span></div><div class=\"fpcol\"><div class=\"fpbar\" style=\"height:3px\"></div><span class=\"fplab\">引け</span></div></div><div class=\"fplegend\">時間帯ごとの出来高（どの時間に売買が集中したか）</div><div class=\"fact\"><span>この日の値動き</span><span class=\"num\">-7.3%（値幅8.4%）</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><span>出来高（普段の日足平均との比）</span><span class=\"num\">0.2倍</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><span>終値とVWAP（1日の平均約定価格）の差</span><span class=\"num\">-1.18%</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><span>寄り30分／引け30分の出来高シェア</span><span class=\"num\">20% ／ 1%</span></div><div class=\"fsub\">裏にいそうな売買主体（機械推定・上位2件）</div><div class=\"factor\"><div class=\"factorh\">🎯 個人の短期資金（イナゴ・飛びつき買い）<span class=\"fconf\">一致度50・確度中</span></div><div class=\"exhwhy\">・瞬間的な出来高スパイク16倍（イナゴ的な集中）</div><div class=\"exhwhy\">・午前に高値→その後失速（買いが続かず利確に押される形）</div></div><div class=\"discnote\">リアルタイムの板（気配値・注文残）は取引所の有料データのため、場中の5分足の値動きと出来高の「形」から典型パターンとの一致度で推定しています。実際の注文主体を特定するものではありません。寄り集中＝個人の飛びつき、引け集中＋VWAP沿い＝機関の執行、出来高増なのに値幅が静か＝大口の仕込み、といった市場の経験則を採点式にしたものです。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><polyline points=\"4.0,37.1 9.1,42.2 14.2,26.4 19.3,24.3 24.5,33.5 29.6,31.3 34.7,26.9 39.8,28.2 44.9,27.5 50.0,32.7 55.1,29.4 60.3,30.1 65.4,27.6 70.5,26.9 75.6,27.9 80.7,35.9 85.8,37.1 91.0,39.6 96.1,34.3 101.2,12.8 106.3,52.8 111.4,53.7 116.5,59.7 121.6,56.9 126.8,59.5 131.9,59.1 137.0,65.5 142.1,70.1 147.2,71.9 152.3,74.1 157.4,78.4 162.6,76.5 167.7,78.1 172.8,78.7 177.9,81.5 183.0,83.6 188.1,87.1 193.2,84.6 198.4,72.3 203.5,79.4 208.6,78.7 213.7,81.4 218.8,82.8 223.9,79.0 229.0,76.0 234.2,80.2 239.3,74.1 244.4,77.0 249.5,78.8 254.6,75.4 259.7,72.0 264.9,74.2 270.0,78.8 275.1,81.2 280.2,84.3 285.3,86.7 290.4,90.1 295.5,87.0 300.7,90.4 305.8,92.6 310.9,91.3 316.0,97.2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"97.2\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display:\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><polyline points=\"4.0,67.6 7.1,68.4 10.2,61.6 13.3,61.0 16.4,45.5 19.4,46.4 22.5,42.7 25.6,40.5 28.7,45.9 31.8,51.5 34.9,43.3 38.0,36.5 41.1,36.6 44.2,31.6 47.2,35.0 50.3,28.5 53.4,18.3 56.5,20.2 59.6,23.4 62.7,26.6 65.8,21.3 68.9,20.4 72.0,41.7 75.0,23.5 78.1,21.2 81.2,28.0 84.3,28.6 87.4,12.8 90.5,60.6 93.6,60.8 96.7,60.5 99.8,60.4 102.9,60.0 105.9,61.5 109.0